{"id":"applaudissement","lemma":"applaudissement","pos":"noun","rank":3561,"glosses":["applause, clapping"],"ipa":"/a.plo.dis.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-applaudissement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-applaudissement.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"applaudissements"},"formAudio":{"applaudissements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-applaudissements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Retenez vos applaudissements, je vous prie.","en":"Hold your applause, please.","words":[{"g":"to hold back, rein in","l":"retenir"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to pray","l":"prier"}]},{"text":"Les applaudissements ont fusé.","en":"Applause broke out.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null]},{"text":"J'entendais des applaudissements.","en":"I could hear everybody cheering.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"entendre"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Des applaudissements ont éclaté.","en":"Applause broke out.","words":[{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lame"}]},{"text":"Les astronautes ont été accueillis par les acclamations et les applaudissements d'une foule enthousiaste.","en":"The astronauts were greeted with cheers and applause of an enthusiastic crowd.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"astronaut","l":"astronaute"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to welcome","l":"accueillir"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"acclamation","l":"acclamation"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"crowd"},{"g":"inspired, passionate"}]}]}